{"5002430":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"CATENA - Chapter I","steam_appid":5002430,"required_age":0,"is_free":true,"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>One body divided. Two players united.<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An asymmetric couch co-op where survival means working as one.<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A massive rift has torn reality apart. The sorcerer <strong>TABES<\/strong> strikes on two fronts at once:  the Physical Realm and the Astral Plane. To fight back, the echo <strong>CATENA<\/strong> splits her body in two. Bound by a chain, both players share <strong>one life pool<\/strong> and <strong>one weapon.<\/strong><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Choose your character:<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎮 <strong>The Physical Catena (Player 1)<\/strong>: pure will to live, courage, near-naive optimism. She matches the brutal rhythm of the real world.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎮 <strong>The Astral Catena (Player 2)<\/strong>: the sum of her suppressed fears. Cynical, pessimistic, questions every step.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Core Gameplay<\/strong><\/h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >⚔️ Asymmetric Combat<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Armored husks only take damage in the real world \/ spirits must be banished on the astral plane. Fight mirrored enemy hordes together - every hit demands coordination.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5002430\/extras\/5af7e02ac0208985396d5cf60f7416ea.poster.avif?t=1793728784\" width=682 height=384 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5002430\/extras\/5af7e02ac0208985396d5cf60f7416ea.webm?t=1793728784\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5002430\/extras\/5af7e02ac0208985396d5cf60f7416ea.mp4?t=1793728784\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🔄 The Weapon Toss<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Toss the single sword between players to swap roles instantly: one fights with melee combos, the other protects with tactical wind control.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5002430\/extras\/f229e24f49d98186f9b8c72e3353d0fd.poster.avif?t=1793728784\" width=682 height=384 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5002430\/extras\/f229e24f49d98186f9b8c72e3353d0fd.webm?t=1793728784\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5002430\/extras\/f229e24f49d98186f9b8c72e3353d0fd.mp4?t=1793728784\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🏄 Windsurfing &amp; Platforming<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slide at high speed across open fields and time your jumps on crumbling rocks.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🗿 Runestones<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Activate ancient, humming stones for a lasting healing aura - your anchor point mid-fight.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore Ktonia<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step out of the cave into a vast, wind-swept world where the ancestors speak through runestones.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5002430\/extras\/fa550c801437c0421cb0138f5fd8d517.poster.avif?t=1793728784\" width=682 height=384 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5002430\/extras\/fa550c801437c0421cb0138f5fd8d517.webm?t=1793728784\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5002430\/extras\/fa550c801437c0421cb0138f5fd8d517.mp4?t=1793728784\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Loot with Impact<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fallen enemies drop powerful boosts: <strong>Shield<\/strong>, <strong>Time Slow<\/strong>, and <strong>Score Multiplier<\/strong>.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5002430\/extras\/45cc715644f309056286c68d327a2f0c.poster.avif?t=1793728784\" width=682 height=384 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5002430\/extras\/45cc715644f309056286c68d327a2f0c.webm?t=1793728784\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5002430\/extras\/45cc715644f309056286c68d327a2f0c.mp4?t=1793728784\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Team &amp; the Project<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Made by <strong>Team Mouseworks<\/strong> (5 students) in 3 months at HNU as a fifth-semester project, and showcased at <strong>Gamescom 2026<\/strong>.<\/p>","about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>One body divided. Two players united.<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An asymmetric couch co-op where survival means working as one.<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A massive rift has torn reality apart. The sorcerer <strong>TABES<\/strong> strikes on two fronts at once:  the Physical Realm and the Astral Plane. To fight back, the echo <strong>CATENA<\/strong> splits her body in two. Bound by a chain, both players share <strong>one life pool<\/strong> and <strong>one weapon.<\/strong><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Choose your character:<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎮 <strong>The Physical Catena (Player 1)<\/strong>: pure will to live, courage, near-naive optimism. She matches the brutal rhythm of the real world.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎮 <strong>The Astral Catena (Player 2)<\/strong>: the sum of her suppressed fears. Cynical, pessimistic, questions every step.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Core Gameplay<\/strong><\/h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >⚔️ Asymmetric Combat<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Armored husks only take damage in the real world \/ spirits must be banished on the astral plane. Fight mirrored enemy hordes together - every hit demands coordination.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5002430\/extras\/5af7e02ac0208985396d5cf60f7416ea.poster.avif?t=1793728784\" width=682 height=384 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5002430\/extras\/5af7e02ac0208985396d5cf60f7416ea.webm?t=1793728784\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5002430\/extras\/5af7e02ac0208985396d5cf60f7416ea.mp4?t=1793728784\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🔄 The Weapon Toss<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Toss the single sword between players to swap roles instantly: one fights with melee combos, the other protects with tactical wind control.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5002430\/extras\/f229e24f49d98186f9b8c72e3353d0fd.poster.avif?t=1793728784\" width=682 height=384 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5002430\/extras\/f229e24f49d98186f9b8c72e3353d0fd.webm?t=1793728784\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5002430\/extras\/f229e24f49d98186f9b8c72e3353d0fd.mp4?t=1793728784\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🏄 Windsurfing &amp; Platforming<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slide at high speed across open fields and time your jumps on crumbling rocks.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🗿 Runestones<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Activate ancient, humming stones for a lasting healing aura - your anchor point mid-fight.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore Ktonia<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step out of the cave into a vast, wind-swept world where the ancestors speak through runestones.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5002430\/extras\/fa550c801437c0421cb0138f5fd8d517.poster.avif?t=1793728784\" width=682 height=384 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5002430\/extras\/fa550c801437c0421cb0138f5fd8d517.webm?t=1793728784\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5002430\/extras\/fa550c801437c0421cb0138f5fd8d517.mp4?t=1793728784\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Loot with Impact<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fallen enemies drop powerful boosts: <strong>Shield<\/strong>, <strong>Time Slow<\/strong>, and <strong>Score Multiplier<\/strong>.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5002430\/extras\/45cc715644f309056286c68d327a2f0c.poster.avif?t=1793728784\" width=682 height=384 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5002430\/extras\/45cc715644f309056286c68d327a2f0c.webm?t=1793728784\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5002430\/extras\/45cc715644f309056286c68d327a2f0c.mp4?t=1793728784\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Team &amp; the Project<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Made by <strong>Team Mouseworks<\/strong> (5 students) in 3 months at HNU as a fifth-semester project, and showcased at <strong>Gamescom 2026<\/strong>.<\/p>","short_description":"CATENA is a co-op action-adventure about two players chained together, sharing one body, one life pool, and one weapon. Toss the blade to swap roles and battle mirrored enemies across two realms as one.","supported_languages":"English<strong>*<\/strong><br><strong>*<\/strong>languages with full audio support","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5002430\/49da2632b9149d8b9b834b5194eb2404a3c164a1\/header.jpg?t=1793728784","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5002430\/bc31df1d209d17b6fda0a5ee71486a93ba60b666\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793728784","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5002430\/bc31df1d209d17b6fda0a5ee71486a93ba60b666\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793728784","website":null,"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10 (64-Bit)<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core i5-8400 or AMD Ryzen 5 2600<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 16 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> NVIDIA GTX 1060 (6 GB) or AMD RX 580<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 12<br><\/li><li><strong>Network:<\/strong> Broadband Internet connection<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 2 GB available space<br><\/li><li><strong>Sound Card:<\/strong> DirectX compatible sound card<br><\/li><li><strong>VR Support:<\/strong> Not supported<br><\/li><li><strong>Additional Notes:<\/strong> Broadband Internet connection (required for online leaderboard features)<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10 (64-Bit)<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core i5-12400 or AMD Ryzen 5 5600<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 16 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> NVIDIA RTX 3060 or AMD RX 6600 XT<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 12<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 2 GB available space<br><\/li><li><strong>Sound Card:<\/strong> DirectX compatible sound card<br><\/li><li><strong>VR Support:<\/strong> Not supported<br><\/li><li><strong>Additional Notes:<\/strong> Broadband Internet connection (required for online leaderboard features)<\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":[],"linux_requirements":[],"developers":["Mouseworks"],"publishers":["Mouseworks"],"package_groups":[],"platforms":{"windows":true,"mac":false,"linux":false},"categories":[{"id":1,"description":"Multi-player"},{"id":9,"description":"Co-op"},{"id":39,"description":"Shared\/Split Screen Co-op"},{"id":24,"description":"Shared\/Split Screen"},{"id":28,"description":"Full controller support"},{"id":62,"description":"Family Sharing"}],"genres":[{"id":"1","description":"Action"},{"id":"25","description":"Adventure"},{"id":"37","description":"Free To Play"}],"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5002430\/35772e89e71c8fa6fde32e5b69c60a62a03b6b8a\/ss_35772e89e71c8fa6fde32e5b69c60a62a03b6b8a.600x338.jpg?t=1793728784","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/st